    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρόομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>become dull</i> or <i>sluggish</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμωρώθη ἡ καρδίη</span>
			<i>was stupefied</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Virg.</u>
				1
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶγες] ἑστᾶσιν ὥσπερ
				μεμωρωμέναι</span> as if <i>stupefied</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				610b30
			</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωραίνω</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μεμωρωμένα</span>
			<i>imbecility</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.92
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμωρῶσθαι περί τι</span> prob.
			l. in <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				25
			</span></i>.</div>
